、\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYMR3SA85EJ46FKPXBJCEMB","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n もう20歳か〜と\n 一人でしみじみしていました。\n \n \n \n \n 今回の握手会で自分がこれからやりたいこと、叶えたい目標が少しずつ明確になってきた気がしました。\n \n \n \n ファンの皆さんからの言葉ってものすごく大きいですね。ありがとう。\n \n \n \n 皆さんに素敵なお知らせができるようにこれから頑張ります。\n \n ✨✨\n \n \n \n \n そしてそして〜\n 写真集 『 誰も知らない私 』が\n 皆さんにとっても思い出に残る素敵な作品になったら嬉しいな。\n \n \n \n \n ギャップずみこをお楽しみに。\n \n 😆😍😎\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYMR5ASGZDYNC7EDAP2GFQ5","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYMR6BFQ769A0H1JKDCK803","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYMR7AGMNQHAWQJ3K77JDX9","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n またね"}],"source":"archive"},"sba-hinata-25750":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんこんにちは〜٩( ᐛ )و"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"けやき坂46 2期生の丹生明里(にぶあかり)です🐸🥕"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1YGNBAG8DJA73RDWJNBHBE","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nあかりとみやも〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近きんちゃんがかまってくるのですあ、これはみんなにですね 笑でもかわいいんです 笑妹みたいなんです 笑\nそんなきんちゃんは最近眉毛を太くしたらしいです 笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きんちゃんっていうのは…金村美玖のことです🍣"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"~まなもクエスション！~"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"第四弾だよ〜👏"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やったあ！！！！\n "},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それじゃあいきますね😋"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragr